</div><div class="uk-panel uk-margin"><p>As one of our premier local business partners, GlobalFoundries currently employs over 50 SUNY FMCC graduates.  Many of these students trained at GlobalFoundries prior to graduation setting them up for success at the start of their career.</p></div>
